{comment: Verse 1}
[Em]Like a king [D/F#] [G]your light [C]shines. [G]
[Em]You are [C]everlasting; [G]none compares with [D]you.

{comment: Verse 2}
[Em]Gently you [D/F#] [G]lead me [C]on [G]
[Em]into [C]your light. [G]I may dwell with [D]you.

{comment: Chorus}
[G]Be the [D/F#]center of my [Em]life,
the [C]center of my [G]heart;
I [Bm]belong to you. [Em]
[C]Be [G]the [D/F#]center in my [Em]weakness,
the [C]center in my [G]strength;
I [Bm]belong to you. [Em][C]

{comment: Bridge}
[C]I want to be near you; [Em7]I will [D]follow you. [G][Bm]
[C]I want to lose [Em7]my whole life in [D]you.
